### Sunlight Wolf setup

This route chooses to set up [_Fire King Sanctuary_] via [_Legendary Fire King Ponix_], the way you know and love. 

That said, you're no longer able to reach Promethean Princess anymore without playing into [_Nibiru, the Primal Being_]. As such, you can instead make use of [_Fire King High Avatar Garunix_]'s effect to trigger [_Salamangreat Sunlight Wolf_] and recover a card from the GY.

